Requirement	Status
Template file /usr/ecommerce-t1q2/ecommerce-t1q2.yml exists	✅ Created
Pod ecommerce-nginx-t1q2 exists	✅ Created via template
Pod uses image nginx	✅ Confirmed
Notes
If the pod already exists from a previous attempt, you may want to delete it first with kubectl delete pod ecommerce-nginx-t1q2 before reapplying, or use kubectl apply which handles updates gracefully.

The containerPort: 80 is optional metadata — it doesn't expose the port outside the pod but documents the intended port. If you need external access, consider a Service or adding hostPort / using kubectl port-forward.

To troubleshoot, use kubectl describe pod ecommerce-nginx-t1q2 and kubectl logs ecommerce-nginx-t1q2.
